sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Admin as Local operator
  participant UI as Dashboard
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant ESP as ESP32 USB serial console
  participant Sensor as AS608

  Admin->>UI: Create synthetic student record
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/students (admin auth)
  API->>DB: Insert PENDING_ENROLLMENT and reserve free slot
  API-->>UI: Student UUID and assigned slot
  Admin->>ESP: Physical console command to enroll student UUID
  ESP->>API: GET enrollment assignment (device token)
  API->>DB: Verify pending state; read slot
  API-->>ESP: Assigned slot only
  loop Two impressions of same finger
    ESP->>Sensor: Capture impression
    Sensor-->>ESP: Capture/template result
    Admin->>Admin: Ask participant to lift finger between captures
  end
  ESP->>Sensor: Merge and store template in assigned slot
  Sensor-->>ESP: Confirm slot write
  ESP->>API: POST enrollment complete (device token; no template data)
  API->>DB: Set student ACTIVE; write audit entry
  API-->>ESP: Confirm activation
  API-->>UI: Student now active on next refresh

  Note over Admin,Sensor: Enrollment/deletion requires authorized physical access; no fingerprint bytes enter the API.
